This documentation explains how to use the CustomSlider feature on this wiki. The required JavaScript is already loaded on this wiki through '''[[MediaWiki:ImportJS]]''', so you can immediately start using this feature without any additional installation steps.

== Limitation ==
Mobile view is currently not supported.

== Dependencies ==
This template depends on '''[[MediaWiki:CustomSlider.js]]''', which has already been installed on this wiki. No additional installation is required. <br/>Status: <i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin-pulse"></i> script under review.

== Basic Usage ==

To create a basic slider, add the following structure to your wiki page:

<pre>
<div id="SliderView">
  <div id="SliderWrapper">
    <div class="Sld">
      [[File:image1.png]]
    </div>
    <div class="Sld">
      [[File:image2.png]]
    </div>
    <div class="Sld">
      [[File:image3.png]]
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="NavBtns">
    <div class="NavBtn"></div>
    <div class="NavBtn"></div>
    <div class="NavBtn"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="SliderData">3|5000|auto|right|100%|bottom</div>
</div>
</pre>

