== Uploading Images ==

For best results with the slider:

# Upload your images to the wiki using [[Special:Upload]]
# Use the File: prefix when referencing images in your slider, e.g., <code><nowiki>[[File:MyImage.jpg]]</nowiki></code>

== Troubleshooting ==

* '''Slider Not Working:''' Ensure you have included all required elements with the correct IDs and classes.
* '''Images Not Displaying Correctly:''' Check that your image paths are correct and that the <code>Height</code> setting is appropriate for your images.
* '''Navigation Buttons Not Showing:''' Verify that you have the correct number of <code>.NavBtn</code> elements matching your slide count.
* '''Auto-rotation Not Working:''' Make sure the interval value is at least 1000 (1 second).

== Tips for Best Results ==

# Use images of the same dimensions for consistent slider appearance
# If using a fixed height, set it appropriately for your image sizes
# Use the <code>overlay</code> caption position for a modern look
# For timed content, set appropriate intervals (3000-5000ms is typical)
# Test your slider in different screen sizes to ensure responsiveness